    <li><strong>Your content</strong>, meaning the products you test, the findings produced, and the evidence recorded, is yours.</li>
    <li><strong>Our software</strong>, brand, and trademarks remain ours.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Licence.</strong> Subject to these terms and your plan, you get a non-exclusive, non-transferable,
